            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TeeganKaydie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great soup that my kids love. I have made some simple changes though. By using Bouillon tablets, I am able to throw in a vegetable tablet with the chicken broth and it's a nicer flavor then the ready made broth, plus the kids get some extra vegetables. I also changed the parsley for Dill Weed, which gives the soup an added kick of flavor and for the kids I make smaller matzo balls. But I love the recipe for the matzo balls and find they work out every time!!!",
            "datePublished": "2010-02-26T07:18:37.453Z"
          },
